umentation\/Swami","kind":"symbol","title":"Swami","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami","type":"topic"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/textCase(_:)":{"kind":"symbol","title":"textCase(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/textcase(_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/textCase(_:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"textCase"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Text","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4TextV"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Case","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4TextV4CaseO"},{"kind":"text","text":"?) -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"View","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP"}]}}}